  "Subject of the email: SF Trip.   Body: Just wanted to send some good vibes your way! It's a beautiful day here with sunshine everywhere, and you popped into my thoughts. Wishing you a day full of good things \u2013 maybe some chill time and a little bit of fun. I tried out a new recipe today, and it made me think about how much I appreciate our chats. Would love to catch up with you next week for coffee if you're free. Even a quick hello would make my night even better. The evening here is nice and quiet, perfect for thinking, and you were definitely on my mind. 